Patches for the vendor blob repo that this tree expects.
Apply from the ROM source root:

    git -C vendor/xiaomi/sm8650-common apply $(pwd)/device/xiaomi/sm8650-common/vendor-patches/sm8650-common-hals-conf.patch

    # displayfeature.default.so -> libtinyxml2_1.so (fixes displayfeature crash), apply in order:
    git -C vendor/xiaomi/sm8650-common apply $(pwd)/device/xiaomi/sm8650-common/vendor-patches/sm8650-common-displayfeature-tinyxml2-1-blob.patch
    git -C vendor/xiaomi/sm8650-common apply $(pwd)/device/xiaomi/sm8650-common/vendor-patches/sm8650-common-displayfeature-tinyxml2-2-bp.patch

    # drop the "haptics output" mix port from both audio policy configs, so incoming calls
    # ring and vibrate while a Bluetooth headset is connected:
    git -C vendor/xiaomi/sm8650-common apply $(pwd)/device/xiaomi/sm8650-common/vendor-patches/sm8650-common-audio-no-haptics.patch
